title Vinyl P2a: the sleep timer's end (a 15-minute timer with 2 s left): the music paused, the notice "Sleep timer ended. Paused." on now playing (640x480 (9.01 px/mm))
sizes 640x480
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP 15
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP_LEFT 2

wait 3000
shot 01-now-sleep-ended
expect text "Sleep timer ended. Paused."
expect noquit
